1
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,080
早上好
Morning.

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:07,160
-嘿 -你睡得好吗
- Hey. - You sleep all right?

3
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:09,180
没睡好 你呢
No, you?

4
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:12,300
-说没有 菲尔 -当然没有
- Say no, Phil. - Of course no.

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,860
我一直在想你
I missed you up there.

6
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:16,340
昨晚 我知道我有点过激...
Last night, I know I got kind of carried away --

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:17,934
不不不 你不需要抱歉
No, no, no. You don't need to apologize.

8
00:00:18,421 --> 00:00:19,761
我可不觉得我是在道...
I don't think that I was apologi--

9
00:00:20,258 --> 00:00:21,133
你有理由生气
You were right to be mad.

10
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:25,100
有时候我觉得只有尖叫
Sometimes I just feel like I have to scream

11
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,020
才能让你知道我有多沮丧
to let you know how upset I am,

12
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,720
但是你现在明白了 对吧
but you get it now, right?

13
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:30,480
我 明白了
I...do.

14
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:31,540
才怪
Not.

15
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:33,845
完全摸不着头脑
No idea whatsoever.

16
00:00:33,845 --> 00:00:36,820
如果我知道 但是
Ohh, if I knew, but...

17
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:38,180
我真的不知道
no.

18
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,500
很好
Good.

19
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,860
我们就假装这件事从未发生过
So let's pretend the whole thing never happened.

20
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:44,960
是啊 我们为了什么事而争吵啊
What were we even fighting about, huh?

21
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:49,180
这里发生什么事了
What the heck happened in here?

22
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:51,580
又有浣熊从狗洞钻进来了吗
The raccoon get through the dog door again?

23
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,180
是的 有浣熊进来了
Yep. The raccoon got in,

24
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:55,800
你妈妈用灭火器把它赶跑了
and your mom fought it off with the fire extinguisher.

25
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,322
你看起来乱糟糟的
You're a mess!

26
00:00:57,322 --> 00:00:58,520
你还好吗
Are you okay?

27
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:01,020
小心点 伙计 今天不要惹你妈
Careful, buddy. Not today.

28
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,307
我认为你看起来美极了
I think you look beautiful.

29
00:01:02,307 --> 00:01:03,660
省省吧
Save it.

30
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:06,940
有一次我忘了给歌洛莉亚买生日礼物
One time I forgot to get Gloria a birthday present,

31
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:08,300
我为此付出了代价
and I paid for it.

32
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,460
有一次我虽记得 但她却不喜欢那个礼物
Another time I remembered, but she didn't like the gift.

33
00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:11,789
我为那也付出了代价
I paid for that.

34
00:01:11,789 --> 00:01:14,730
那么你会想 如果我记得她的生日
So you'd think when I remember to buy her a gift

35
00:01:14,730 --> 00:01:16,710
她又刚好喜欢那个礼物
and she loves it,

36
00:01:16,710 --> 00:01:18,690
那我就不必遭殃了 对吧
I wouldn't have to pay for it, right?

37
00:01:19,123 --> 00:01:25,810
叫我早上滴天使 天使
Just call me angel of the morning, angel

38
00:01:26,243 --> 00:01:33,523
在你走之前 虎摸我的脸颊 宝贝
Just touch my cheek before you leave me, baby

39
00:01:52,310 --> 00:01:53,390
很好
Oh, hey, good.

40
00:01:53,390 --> 00:01:55,190
抓住这个桌子的另一边 帮我把它抬出去
Grab the other end of this and help me get it out of here.

41
00:01:55,190 --> 00:01:56,810
我要开始为今晚准备椅子了
I have to start setting up the chairs for tonight.

42
00:01:57,087 --> 00:01:58,570
-今晚 今晚有什么 -开什么玩笑
- Oh, tonight? What's tonight? - Are you kidding me?

43
00:01:58,810 --> 00:02:00,590
我就是我一直纠结的地方 米奇尔
This is what I'm talking about Mitchell.

44
00:02:00,590 --> 00:02:02,210
你总是把我的话当耳旁风 当我...
You never listen when I --

45
00:02:02,237 --> 00:02:03,203
这是一个为第三街立交桥音乐之友协会的
It's a fundraiser for the friends

46
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,617
朋友们举办的筹集资金的活动
of the third street overpass music society.

47
00:02:04,617 --> 00:02:06,097
会有两个竖琴师来表演
Two harpists are performing,

48
00:02:06,097 --> 00:02:07,350
你很焦虑 因为安德鲁
and you're anxious 'cause Andrew,

49
00:02:07,350 --> 00:02:08,850
他是你在督导委员会的宿敌
Your nemesis from the steering committee,

50
00:02:08,850 --> 00:02:09,710
他去年举办了这个活动
ran the event last year,

51
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:10,710
而你想全面超越他的那次
and you want to upstage him.

52
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:11,430
我是开玩笑的
I was kidding.

53
00:02:12,830 --> 00:02:14,270
小卡总是认为
Cam has it in his head

54
00:02:14,270 --> 00:02:16,730
我不听他说话 但其实我有听
that I don't listen to him, but I do.

55
00:02:16,730 --> 00:02:19,510
有在听吗 米奇尔 有吗
Do you, Mitchell? Do you?

56
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:20,490
医生打电话来说
The doctor called and said

57
00:02:20,550 --> 00:02:22,050
莉莉没得皮疹 那只是皮肤干燥
Lily's rash is just dry skin.

58
00:02:22,050 --> 00:02:23,030
我终于可以松口气了
I'm so relieved.

59
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:24,970
我刚对你说了什么
What did I just say?

60
00:02:24,970 --> 00:02:27,890
你表现得你会听我讲述每一件事
You act like you listen to every single thing that I say,

61
00:02:27,890 --> 00:02:28,870
但其实你没有
but you don't.

62
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:29,730
我没有吗 米奇尔
Don't I, Mitchell?

63
00:02:29,730 --> 00:02:31,550
我今天会去商店
Hey, I'm going to the store today.

64
00:02:31,550 --> 00:02:33,210
你要我给你带点什么吗
Do you need me to pick anything up for you?

65
00:02:33,210 --> 00:02:36,961
刀片 生理盐水 黑袜
Razor blades, saline solution, black socks,

66
00:02:36,961 --> 00:02:40,610
和新出版的《名利场》
and the new issue of Vanity Fair.

67
00:02:40,610 --> 00:02:42,890
我都不记得我要你给我买这些
Wow. I don't even remember asking for all that.

68
00:02:42,890 --> 00:02:44,390
谢谢
Thank you.

69
00:02:44,390 --> 00:02:46,930
我没有吗
Don't I?

70
00:02:48,132 --> 00:02:49,855
这个到底是怎么掉下来的
How'd this thing come off, anyway?

71
00:02:49,870 --> 00:02:51,890
我在做晚餐
Well, I was cooking dinner, and --

72
00:02:51,890 --> 00:02:52,190
是的
Right.

73
00:02:52,856 --> 00:02:54,042
一只浣熊突然就进来了
And the raccoon just walked in the --

74
00:02:54,690 --> 00:02:56,488
我已经把这个打开了
And I already had the door open.

75
00:02:56,488 --> 00:02:58,610
-是的 -我也已经抓住
- Right. - Which I-I had already had ahold of the --

76
00:02:58,610 --> 00:03:01,362
你们两个为什么不去把故事编好再回来
Why don't you two go work on your story and come back?

77
00:03:01,362 --> 00:03:02,255
-好的 -好的
- Okay. - Okay.

78
00:03:02,490 --> 00:03:04,070
我今晚会很晚回家
I won't be home till late.

79
00:03:04,070 --> 00:03:05,790
我在餐厅又有一次轮班
I have another shift at the restaurant.

80
00:03:05,790 --> 00:03:06,305
这才是我们的上班女郎
That's our working girl.

81
00:03:06,305 --> 00:03:06,701
让河流流淌吧 亲爱的
Let the river run, honey.

82
00:03:06,701 --> 00:03:08,250
看 昨晚的57美元小费
Check it! $57 in tips from last night.

83
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:14,670
亲爱的 这真是太棒了 你知道吗
Honey, that's impressive. You know what?

84
00:03:14,670 --> 00:03:17,630
你的57美元 再加上我们的57美元
$57 from you, $57 from us --

85
00:03:17,630 --> 00:03:18,270
你继续下去的话
You keep this up,

86
00:03:18,270 --> 00:03:20,910
这个夏天我们就可以给你买辆车
we are going to be buying you a car by the summer.

87
00:03:21,026 --> 00:03:22,937
妈妈 这是高档休闲装吗
Mom, is this "upscale casual"?

88
00:03:22,937 --> 00:03:24,150
什么
What?

89
00:03:24,150 --> 00:03:25,390
是的 小卡雇了卢克
Oh, yeah. Cam hired Luke

90
00:03:25,390 --> 00:03:26,730
要他帮忙今晚的慈善活动
to help out with the benefit tonight.

91
00:03:26,730 --> 00:03:28,350
你知道吗 我修不好这个
Hey, you know what? I can't fix this thing.

92
00:03:28,735 --> 00:03:30,128
什么 我需要它 我每天都得用它
What? I need that. I use it every day.

93
00:03:30,570 --> 00:03:32,030
好吧 菲尔 你说呢
Okay, Phil, what do you say?

94
00:03:32,030 --> 00:03:33,210
你想跟我一起去购物中心吗
You want to take a trip to the mall with me?

95
00:03:33,210 --> 00:03:35,470
想去
I...do.

96
00:03:35,470 --> 00:03:36,410
才怪
Not,

97
00:03:36,410 --> 00:03:37,780
我能闪就闪
if I can possibly avoid it.

98
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:41,068
克莱尔在购物中心有个
Claire has this little...habit...

99
00:03:41,068 --> 00:03:43,230
小小的习惯 她
at the mall, where sh--

100
00:03:43,230 --> 00:03:45,680
我甚至都说不出口
I can't even talk about it.

101
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,670
杰 快点
Jay, come on!

102
00:03:47,670 --> 00:03:48,790
我想回家
I want to go home

103
00:03:48,790 --> 00:03:50,530
因为你说要录下我唱K时的情景
because you said you were going to film me doing the

104
00:03:50,530 --> 00:03:52,850
我就可以把带子寄到哥伦比亚我妈那
karaoke so I can send it to Colombia to my mother.

105
00:03:53,086 --> 00:03:54,139
克莱尔 去购物中心
Claire, um, about the mall?

106
00:03:54,430 --> 00:03:55,550
我下午其实要去外面
I was actually gonna run out

107
00:03:55,550 --> 00:03:56,820
把头发剪了
and get my hair cut this afternoon.

108
00:03:56,820 --> 00:03:57,830
等一下
Well, hang on here.

109
00:03:57,830 --> 00:03:59,750
为什么不让我跟克莱尔去购物中心
Why don't I run claire down the mall,

110
00:03:59,750 --> 00:04:00,890
你来给菲尔理发
and you give Phil a haircut?

111
00:04:00,890 --> 00:04:02,210
你不是总是在讲
You're always talking about

112
00:04:02,210 --> 00:04:03,850
你很想念发廊的工作吗
how you miss working at the salon.

113
00:04:03,850 --> 00:04:05,030
我想我可以的
I guess I could.

114
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:07,570
我能帮杰做 为什么不能帮你做呢
I do jay. Why can't I do you?

115
00:04:07,570 --> 00:04:09,570
你可以"做"我
You...can do me.

116
00:04:09,570 --> 00:04:10,751
好的 我们让派对开始
Okay, let's get this party started.

117
00:04:10,751 --> 00:04:13,197
你知道那首歌吗
You know that song?

118
00:04:13,454 --> 00:04:14,537
我们快走 快走 我们在浪费时间
Let's go, let's go! We're wasting time!

119
00:04:14,537 --> 00:04:16,302
-好的 好的 -知道
- O-okay, okay. - Yeah.

120
00:04:16,604 --> 00:04:18,459
-你知道吗 -我想是的
- You know it? - I think I do.

121
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:21,070
那么 刚刚那是安德鲁
So, that was Andrew,

122
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:23,230
他几乎是哽咽着跟我说
who practically choked telling me

123
00:04:23,230 --> 00:04:25,470
没有人致电表示很抱歉
that no one had called in their regrets

124
00:04:25,470 --> 00:04:26,330
参加不了今天的活动
for the event tonight.

125
00:04:26,330 --> 00:04:27,794
今晚一定是座无虚席
It is gonna be a full house.

126
00:04:27,794 --> 00:04:29,179
那一定让你感觉很爽
Oh, that must feel great!

127
00:04:29,179 --> 00:04:31,711
我从未想过我会享受宿敌的存在
Oh, I never thought I would enjoy having an arch enemy. Oh.

128
00:04:31,711 --> 00:04:34,530
但是 我很享受 米奇尔 很享受
But I do, Mitchell. I do. Hmm.

129
00:04:34,530 --> 00:04:36,310
莉莉 你在玩什么呢
Hey, Lily, what you got there?

130
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:38,245
我真为PETA的那些人感到难过
I do feel bad for those PETA folks.

131
00:04:38,245 --> 00:04:39,670
他们的活动也是在今晚
Their event's tonight, too.

132
00:04:39,670 --> 00:04:42,210
所以我才老早就让你把邀请函寄出去
That's why I had you mail the invitations so long ago.

133
00:04:42,210 --> 00:04:43,450
我不应该笑的
I shouldn't laugh.

134
00:04:43,450 --> 00:04:45,870
我确实为那些动物感到难过
I do feel bad for those little PETA animals.

135
00:04:45,870 --> 00:04:47,650
真的
I really do.

136
00:04:47,650 --> 00:04:48,450
你在做什么
What are you doing?

137
00:04:48,450 --> 00:04:49,390
没什么 她在
Nothing. She was, uh --

138
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,754
她又在吸吮她的大拇指
she was, uh, sucking her thumb again.

139
00:04:50,873 --> 00:04:53,403
没错 我把小卡的邀请函放在车上
Yes, I put Cam's invites in my car

140
00:04:53,493 --> 00:04:54,580
准备带去邮局的
to take them to the post office

141
00:04:54,670 --> 00:04:56,250
但我把我的健身包放在那上面了
and then threw my gym bag on top of them

142
00:04:56,250 --> 00:04:57,890
完全忘记它们的存在了
and completely forgot they existed.

143
00:04:58,803 --> 00:05:00,948
我感觉糟透了
Ohh, I feel terrible.

144
00:05:01,230 --> 00:05:03,603
六周没有去健身房了
Haven't been to the gym in six weeks.

145
00:05:03,603 --> 00:05:06,119
而且还把小卡的活动搞砸了
And I ruined Cam's event.

146
00:05:07,250 --> 00:05:09,425
你好 哈特威克女士
Hello, Miss Hartwick.

147
00:05:09,425 --> 00:05:11,570
小卡和我今天晚上
Uh, Cam and I are hosting

148
00:05:11,570 --> 00:05:13,470
举办一个小型活动
a little event tonight, and --

149
00:05:13,470 --> 00:05:14,396
是的 是的
Yes, yes.

150
00:05:14,396 --> 00:05:15,905
不 我知道今晚PETA也会有活动
No, I am aware that there is also a PETA event,

151
00:05:15,905 --> 00:05:17,050
还有
and -- ohh.

152
00:05:17,050 --> 00:05:19,750
你在跟谁说话
Who are you talking to?

153
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:21,230
我在冲凉
I'm in the shower!

154
00:05:21,312 --> 00:05:22,810
卢克 椅子摆的怎么样了
Luke, how are those chairs coming?

155
00:05:22,910 --> 00:05:23,630
呼叫
Come in.

156
00:05:23,630 --> 00:05:25,045
我想你应该来看看 呼叫
I think you should come in come in.

157
00:05:25,045 --> 00:05:27,110
现在我很担心连贯性
Oh, now I'm worried about the flow.

158
00:05:27,110 --> 00:05:29,970
他们应该看着竖琴 而不是椅背
The eyes should go to the harps, not the backs of chairs.

159
00:05:29,970 --> 00:05:31,187
你会变得情绪低落
Are you gonna get upset

160
00:05:31,187 --> 00:05:33,390
然后又把所有的开胃菜都吃掉吗
and starting eating all the appetizers again?

161
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:36,470
你注意到的和没注意到的事情真让人吃惊
It is amazing what you notice and what you don't notice.

162
00:05:36,470 --> 00:05:39,270
请你处理一下 我需要想想
Please handle that. I need to think.

163
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:41,370
给点力 卢克
Come on, Luke.

164
00:05:41,370 --> 00:05:44,590
你好 你爸爸在家吗
Hi, there. Your father home?

165
00:05:44,590 --> 00:05:46,350
应该在家 怎么了
I think so. Why?

166
00:05:46,425 --> 00:05:47,135
是接待人员
Oh, oh! The wait staff.

167
00:05:47,210 --> 00:05:50,010
卢克 请把他们领到厨房去
Please, luke, show them to the kitchen, please.

168
00:05:50,010 --> 00:05:52,870
有人吗
Knock knock.

169
00:05:52,870 --> 00:05:54,010
你好 安德鲁
Oh. Hello, Andrew.

170
00:05:54,010 --> 00:05:55,350
椅背看起来不错
Nice chair backs.

171
00:05:55,350 --> 00:05:57,141
我想你会用得上这个
I just thought you could use this.

172
00:05:57,141 --> 00:05:59,550
这是我去年活动的签名簿
It's the sign-in book for my event last year.

173
00:05:59,550 --> 00:06:01,290
让我们翻到空白页
Let just turn to the blank pages,

174
00:06:01,290 --> 00:06:02,310
那是在
Which should be...

175
00:06:03,290 --> 00:06:04,970
不 全写满了
Oh. No. It's full.

176
00:06:04,970 --> 00:06:06,730
谢谢你为我们着想
Oh, well, thank you for thinking of us,

177
00:06:06,730 --> 00:06:08,370
但是你不是应该回家去陪唐纳德吗
but shouldn't you be getting back home to Donald?

178
00:06:08,370 --> 00:06:10,530
那是你猫咪的名字 不是吗
That is the name of your cat, isn't it?

179
00:06:10,689 --> 00:06:11,951
我们七点见
I'll see you at 7:00.

180
00:06:12,110 --> 00:06:12,850
开车小心点
Drive safely.

181
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:18,570
我跟你说什么来着
What did I tell you?

182
00:06:18,570 --> 00:06:22,230
她比你说的还差劲
She's even worse than you said.

183
00:06:22,230 --> 00:06:23,530
别动
Hold still!

184
00:06:23,530 --> 00:06:25,830
你不能像这样动来动去
You can't move like that.

185
00:06:25,901 --> 00:06:27,592
这就像在剪布谷鸟的头发一样
It's like cutting the hair of a cuckoo bird.

186
00:06:27,650 --> 00:06:30,110
对不起 我今天有点神经紧绷
I'm sorry. I'm just a little tense today.

187
00:06:30,110 --> 00:06:31,816
我就知道 有事发生了
I knew it. Something happened.

188
00:06:31,816 --> 00:06:34,250
因为当某人在发廊工作时
Because when somebody works in a salon,

189
00:06:34,250 --> 00:06:36,410
有人需要谈心 他们总能发现
they know when someone needs to talk.

190
00:06:36,410 --> 00:06:38,490
事实上 或许你可以帮我解决这个问题
Actually, you might be able to help me with this one.

191
00:06:38,490 --> 00:06:40,205
克莱尔昨晚和我大吵了一架
Claire and I got into a huge fight last night...

192
00:06:40,205 --> 00:06:42,090
我甚至都不知道因为什么
...and I'm not even sure what it was about.

193
00:06:42,090 --> 00:06:44,990
这就是为什么你不跟她去购物中心的原因吗
Was that why you didn't want to go to the mall with her?

194
00:06:44,990 --> 00:06:48,090
不是 那是因为
No, that was... more about a weird...

195
00:06:48,090 --> 00:06:49,810
克莱尔怪异的商场习惯
mall habit claire has.

196
00:06:49,810 --> 00:06:51,170
天呐 真舒服
Oh, my god! That's good!

197
00:06:51,196 --> 00:06:52,556
天呐 低一点 再低一点
Oh, oh! Go low, go low.

198
00:06:52,572 --> 00:06:55,035
低一点 低一点
Go low, go low. Oh! Oh!

199
00:06:55,050 --> 00:06:56,010
天呐
Oh, my god!

200
00:06:56,010 --> 00:06:57,053
老爸老爸
Dad! Dad!

201
00:06:57,053 --> 00:06:59,355
你一定要买一个
You got to get one of these! Oh!

202
00:07:02,970 --> 00:07:05,130
海莉的收入真是让人乍舌
It is impressive how much Haley's earning.

203
00:07:05,130 --> 00:07:06,970
她已经赚了五百多美元
She's over $500 already.

204
00:07:06,970 --> 00:07:07,950
那可是能买很多切达干酪啊
That's a lot of cheddar.

205
00:07:07,997 --> 00:07:08,812
为什么大家都表现的
Why's everyone acting

206
00:07:08,890 --> 00:07:10,850
好像她是首个十七岁有工作的人一样
like she's the first 17-year-old to have a job?

207
00:07:10,850 --> 00:07:12,570
在其他文明中 她都应该有两个孩子了
In other cultures, she'd have two kids already,

208
00:07:12,570 --> 00:07:13,390
孩子们都有工作了
and they'd have jobs.

209
00:07:13,390 --> 00:07:15,176
我去了那个餐厅好几次
You know, I stopped by the restaurant a couple times,

210
00:07:15,176 --> 00:07:16,059
她都不在那里
and she wasn't there.

211
00:07:16,130 --> 00:07:17,470
什么时候
When?

212
00:07:17,626 --> 00:07:18,978
我不记得了
Uh, I don't remember.

213
00:07:19,110 --> 00:07:20,490
我在购物中心看电影
I was at the mall for a movie.

214
00:07:20,490 --> 00:07:21,810
想想 我要知道细节
Think! I need details!

215
00:07:21,810 --> 00:07:23,425
好吧 那是个浪漫的喜剧
Okay, it was a romantic comedy

216
00:07:23,425 --> 00:07:25,430
是我以前的朋友鲁本推荐的
My now ex-friend Reuben recommended --

217
00:07:25,430 --> 00:07:27,010
不是说电影 是哪一天 仔细想
Not about the movie! What day?! Focus!

218
00:07:27,065 --> 00:07:28,460
好吧 是周二
Okay, uh, it was Tuesday,

219
00:07:28,550 --> 00:07:30,670
但我周六也去那里吃饭了
But I also ate there again on Saturday,

220
00:07:30,670 --> 00:07:33,290
她还是不在那里
and she wasn't there then, either.

221
00:07:33,290 --> 00:07:34,990
天呐
Oh, my god.

222
00:07:34,990 --> 00:07:36,910
我打赌她都不在那里工作
I bet she doesn't even work there.

223
00:07:36,910 --> 00:07:38,550
那么 那些钱是哪里来的呢
Well, then, where's all this money coming from?

224
00:07:38,550 --> 00:07:40,070
你注意到每晚
Do you notice how every single night

225
00:07:40,070 --> 00:07:41,530
都正好是少于六十美元吗
is just under $60?

226
00:07:41,530 --> 00:07:44,270
她生日的时候姥爷给了她六十美元
Grandpa gave her $60 for her birthday.

227
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:46,110
她整天去商场无所事事
She's just hanging around the mall all day,

228
00:07:46,110 --> 00:07:47,850
每晚亮出同一笔钱
flashing the same cash every night,

229
00:07:47,850 --> 00:07:50,050
骗我爸妈去给她买辆车
and fooling my parents into buying her a car.

230
00:07:50,050 --> 00:07:51,187
老爸
Hey, dad!

231
00:07:51,187 --> 00:07:53,295
我们今晚能去海莉的餐馆吃饭吗
Can we eat at Haley's restaurant tonight?!

232
00:07:53,350 --> 00:07:54,690
很好啊
Hey, there's a good idea!

233
00:07:54,690 --> 00:07:57,650
真棒 我发短信告诉她
Great. I'll text her.

234
00:07:57,650 --> 00:08:00,410
天呐 不会吧
Oh, god, no!

235
00:08:00,410 --> 00:08:02,390
天呐 真棒
Oh, god, yes!

236
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:05,070
天呐 真棒
Oh! Oh, god, yes!

237
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:06,970
继续
Oh, get after it!

238
00:08:07,828 --> 00:08:09,350
太棒了
Amazing.

239
00:08:09,540 --> 00:08:10,342
我想再试一刻钟
I'm going for 15 more on me.

240
00:08:10,550 --> 00:08:12,450
我觉得你已经体验够了
I think you got what you needed from that.

241
00:08:12,450 --> 00:08:15,870
好吧 谢谢
Oh. Okay. Thank you.

242
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:17,624
你是不是应该跟我谈谈吵架的事情
You know, maybe you do need to talk about this fight.

243
00:08:17,624 --> 00:08:18,830
和菲尔吗
With Phil?

244
00:08:18,830 --> 00:08:22,550
你怎么会不知道她生气的原因
How could you not know what she was mad about?

245
00:08:22,550 --> 00:08:25,043
因为她没告诉我啊 她直接就发狂了
Because she didn't tell me. She just freaked out.

246
00:08:25,043 --> 00:08:27,305
我真是受不了你了 菲尔
I cannot believe you, Phil!

247
00:08:27,305 --> 00:08:29,057
你怎么能这样
How could you?!

248
00:08:29,057 --> 00:08:31,410
怎么了 我 我干了什么
What is happening? What -- what did I do?

249
00:08:31,410 --> 00:08:32,570
不是吧你
Are you serious?

250
00:08:32,570 --> 00:08:33,810
你当真 你真不知道
You are! You don't know.

251
00:08:33,810 --> 00:08:35,330
我们都已经谈过一百遍了
We've had this conversation a hundred times.

252
00:08:35,330 --> 00:08:36,410
你知道 不 不
You know -- no, no.

253
00:08:36,410 --> 00:08:37,690
我不会再说一遍了
I'm not -- I'm not doing this again.

254
00:08:37,690 --> 00:08:40,570
你告诉我你做了什么
You tell me what you did.

255
00:08:41,456 --> 00:08:43,982
-是不是 -"是不是"
- Was it -- - "Was it --"

256
00:08:44,090 --> 00:08:45,850
别说了 菲尔
No, Phil.

257
00:08:45,850 --> 00:08:47,573
算了算了算了
No. No, no, no. No!

258
00:08:47,573 --> 00:08:49,041
-我要去透透气 -克莱尔
- I'm going to get some air. - Claire.

259
00:08:49,041 --> 00:08:50,573
-克莱尔 -别叫我 别跟着我
- Claire! -No! Don't follow me.

260
00:08:50,573 --> 00:08:54,190
情人生日纪念日快乐
Happy valen-birth-iversary!

261
00:08:54,190 --> 00:08:55,200
气呼呼的离开
Storming off --

262
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,309
和你老妈如出一辙
right out of yr mom's playbook.

263
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:59,110
然后你去了哪里
Where'd you go?

264
00:08:59,110 --> 00:09:01,850
结果 我没有走远
Well, as it turns out, not very far.

265
00:09:07,047 --> 00:09:08,500
见鬼
Damn it.

266
00:09:44,533 --> 00:09:45,541
菲尔
Phil!

267
00:09:45,572 --> 00:09:47,471
菲尔 你个蠢货 停下
Phil, you moron, stop it!

268
00:09:47,749 --> 00:09:49,569
-是我 你个蠢货 -对不起
- It's me, you idiot! - I'm sorry!

269
00:09:49,570 --> 00:09:50,509
你在干什么
What are you doing?!

270
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:51,990
对不起
I'm sorry!

271
00:09:51,990 --> 00:09:53,545
我以为是只浣熊
I thought you were a raccoon!

272
00:09:53,545 --> 00:09:55,079
你以为我是只浣熊
You thought I was a raccoon!

273
00:09:55,079 --> 00:09:57,050
因为人看上去像是浣熊
Because people look so much like raccoons.

274
00:09:57,050 --> 00:09:57,810
你看
Oh, look.

275
00:09:57,810 --> 00:09:58,067
这儿就有一只
There's one now!

276
00:09:58,067 --> 00:09:58,810
不要啊 克莱尔 不要 克莱尔
No, claire, no! Claire!

277
00:09:58,810 --> 00:10:05,430
等等
Wait a minute.

278
00:10:05,430 --> 00:10:07,970
疯女人发疯都是有原因的
Not even crazy woman go crazy for no reason.

279
00:10:07,970 --> 00:10:09,870
西兰花之前发生了什么
What happened before the broccoli?

280
00:10:09,870 --> 00:10:11,270
问题就 她突然就爆发了啊
That's just it -- it came out of the blue.

281
00:10:11,270 --> 00:10:12,070
我走进门
I walked in the door,

282
00:10:12,070 --> 00:10:13,725
我们就随便聊聊
we're having a conversation about nothing.

283
00:10:13,725 --> 00:10:15,070
亲爱的
Hey, honey.

284
00:10:15,070 --> 00:10:16,610
抱歉单位有点事耽搁了
Sorry I got stuck at the office.

285
00:10:16,610 --> 00:10:17,450
今天过得怎么样
How was your day?

286
00:10:17,450 --> 00:10:18,375
不错
It was good.

287
00:10:18,375 --> 00:10:19,550
-你知道发生了什么吗 -什么
- Although you know what? - What?

288
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:21,850
黛比午饭放我鸽子了
Debbie stood me up for lunch.

289
00:10:21,850 --> 00:10:22,750
很无礼是吧
Rude, right?

290
00:10:22,750 --> 00:10:24,210
没有啊 她打电话
No. She called.

291
00:10:24,210 --> 00:10:25,550
我没有收到消息啊
I didn't get a message.

292
00:10:25,550 --> 00:10:26,830
你收到了
Yeah. You did.

293
00:10:26,830 --> 00:10:28,370
我给你留字条了
I left you one.

294
00:10:28,370 --> 00:10:31,610
就在这儿
It's right...there.

295
00:10:33,110 --> 00:10:34,950
那就是原因
That's it!

296
00:10:35,100 --> 00:10:37,580
她怎么可能看见这个
How is she supposed to see this?

297
00:10:37,710 --> 00:10:39,933
你要是给我这么小的纸条
If you give me a message this tiny,

298
00:10:39,933 --> 00:10:40,830
我会杀了你
I kill you.

299
00:10:40,830 --> 00:10:43,130
但她不是那时候发狂的
But that's not when she got mad.

300
00:10:43,130 --> 00:10:45,570
我还和保险公司的人谈了谈
Also, I talked to the insurance company

301
00:10:45,570 --> 00:10:48,490
就是那个"不是你的错"小事故
about that little accident that "wasn't your fault"

302
00:10:48,641 --> 00:10:50,959
因为刹车"不正常"
because the brakes weren't "working right."

303
00:10:52,590 --> 00:10:54,750
而且赔的钱也没有我想的多
And that's not gonna cost us as much money as I thought,

304
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:55,470
很好
so that's good.

305
00:10:55,470 --> 00:10:56,390
那就是原因
That's it!

306
00:10:56,770 --> 00:10:58,490
你侮辱一个女人的驾驶技术
You insult a woman's driving,

307
00:10:58,541 --> 00:11:00,252
你还用了手指兔子
and you use the "air bunnies."

308
00:11:00,330 --> 00:11:02,710
你要是对我那样做 我会杀了你
You do that to me, and I kill you.

309
00:11:02,710 --> 00:11:04,010
了解
I hear you,

310
00:11:04,010 --> 00:11:07,310
但是发狂也不是从那时开始的
but the screaming still hadn't started yet.

311
00:11:07,696 --> 00:11:09,336
我不是和斯基普·伍斯纳吃午饭的吗
So, I'm having lunch with Skip Woosnum, right?

312
00:11:09,690 --> 00:11:11,530
天呐 那家伙说个不停
Boy, can that guy go on and on.

313
00:11:11,530 --> 00:11:13,330
都不知道说哪去了
Tangent after tangent.

314
00:11:13,330 --> 00:11:15,270
对了 他还让我对一个超赞的东西产生了兴趣
By the way, turned me on to the greatest thing --

315
00:11:15,270 --> 00:11:17,170
卷心菜沙拉 你应该试试
wedge salad -- you gotta try it.

316
00:11:17,170 --> 00:11:18,250
随便了
Anyhoo...

317
00:11:18,250 --> 00:11:20,450
你猜谁和我们邻桌
Guess who's sitting at the table next to us.

318
00:11:20,450 --> 00:11:23,010
我前女友卡拉
My old girlfriend Carla.

319
00:11:23,950 --> 00:11:25,170
我们打算一起去喝咖啡
We're gonna grab coffee.

320
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,769
她瘦了不少
She lost a ton of weight.

321
00:11:26,850 --> 00:11:28,990
你怎么这么蠢
How stupid are you?

322
00:11:28,990 --> 00:11:31,930
你要是跟我说你去见前女友 我就
You tell me that you're seeing an old girlfriend, and I --

323
00:11:31,930 --> 00:11:32,710
杀了我 我知道
Kill me, I know.

324
00:11:32,710 --> 00:11:34,830
但是她那时还没有爆发
But she still hadn't snapped yet.

325
00:11:34,830 --> 00:11:35,570
差点忘了
I almost forgot.

326
00:11:35,570 --> 00:11:40,010
我买了你要的西兰花
I picked up the broccoli you asked for.

327
00:11:40,010 --> 00:11:41,050
花椰菜
Cauliflower.

328
00:11:41,050 --> 00:11:42,125
真不敢相信我又买错了
Can't believe I did that again.

329
00:11:42,125 --> 00:11:43,530
真是受不了你了 菲尔
I cannot believe you, Phil!

330
00:11:43,530 --> 00:11:47,050
你不是做错一件事
You didn't do one thing wrong.

331
00:11:47,050 --> 00:11:48,750
每件事都做错了
You do everything wrong!

332
00:11:48,926 --> 00:11:51,685
我都不知道她为什么还要跟你说话
I don'even know why she talks to you.

333
00:11:51,850 --> 00:11:53,510
她说她没事的
She said she was okay.

334
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:56,170
不 没有女人会对这种事释怀的
No. No woman is okay with this.

335
00:11:56,170 --> 00:11:57,390
我们不会忘记
We don't forget.

336
00:11:57,390 --> 00:11:58,310
我们等着
We wait.

337
00:11:58,310 --> 00:12:00,133
然后 在你最不经意的时候
And then, when you least expect it,

338
00:12:00,133 --> 00:12:01,674
让你付出应有的代价
we make you pay.

339
00:12:01,674 --> 00:12:03,277
下巴抬起来
Chin up!

340
00:12:03,650 --> 00:12:03,930
抬起来
Up!

341
00:12:03,930 --> 00:12:08,770
这么说你因为那事发飙了
So you had a meltdown over that.

342
00:12:08,770 --> 00:12:10,750
是的 因为自打我遇见他
I did, because ever since I met him,

343
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:13,370
我就想让菲尔试试卷心菜沙拉
I've been trying to get Phil to try a wedge salad.

344
00:12:13,911 --> 00:12:15,435
斯基普·伍斯纳这个他并不喜欢的人
The minute that Skip Woosnum,

345
00:12:15,975 --> 00:12:17,829
一推荐这个
whom he doesn't even like, suggests it,

346
00:12:18,370 --> 00:12:20,030
菲尔就觉得这是最好的东西
Phil thinks it's the greatest thing ever,

347
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:21,890
每一件事都是这样
and he does this with everything.

348
00:12:21,890 --> 00:12:24,250
书 电影 还有电视 都是这样
He does it with books, with movies, with tv.

349
00:12:24,250 --> 00:12:27,110
他听取所有人的意见 除了我的
He listens to everybody's opinion but mine,

350
00:12:27,110 --> 00:12:28,597
这都让我抓狂了
And it drives me crazy.

351
00:12:28,597 --> 00:12:29,950
你们俩今早看上去没事啊
You two seemed fine this morning.

352
00:12:29,950 --> 00:12:32,170
是啊 因为我们讨论过了
Well, we were because we talked about it,

353
00:12:32,170 --> 00:12:32,910
顺便说下
which, by the way,

354
00:12:33,219 --> 00:12:35,121
你要是想解决歌洛莉亚唱K这件事
if you want this whole karaoke thing with Gloria to go away,

355
00:12:35,430 --> 00:12:36,450
你就应该这么做
That's what you need to do.

356
00:12:36,450 --> 00:12:38,610
说着容易做着难
That's easier said than done.

357
00:12:38,610 --> 00:12:41,170
你什么时候开始回避正面冲突了
Well, since when do you shy away from confrontation,

358
00:12:41,170 --> 00:12:44,310
强硬先生 直话直说先生
Mr. Tough Talk, Mr. Straight shooter?

359
00:12:44,499 --> 00:12:46,533
变得温和了吗 老爷子
Getting a little soft, grandpa?

360
00:12:46,710 --> 00:12:48,710
别人给你做按摩的时候
You know, when you get a massage,

361
00:12:49,039 --> 00:12:51,195
你发出的声音就像是蒂华纳的妓女
you sound like a Tijuana prostitute.

362
00:12:57,070 --> 00:12:58,110
卢克 电话
Luke, phone.

363
00:13:02,869 --> 00:13:03,647
第三街的朋友
Friends of the third street --

364
00:13:04,190 --> 00:13:05,710
是米奇尔吗 他怎么这么慢
Is that Mitchell? What's taking him?

365
00:13:05,835 --> 00:13:07,833
不是 不是米奇尔 是
No, it's not Mitchell. It's...

366
00:13:07,930 --> 00:13:09,870
我不明白他的名字
I don't understand his name.

367
00:13:09,870 --> 00:13:10,410
哪位
Hello?

368
00:13:10,410 --> 00:13:12,210
兰吉尼斯 你好 听着
Oh, hi, Longinus. Listen,

369
00:13:12,210 --> 00:13:13,090
你收到我的消息了吗
did you get my message?

370
00:13:13,146 --> 00:13:14,138
关于那个竹节椅的那条
About the chiavari chairs --

371
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:16,623
我想你过来的时候带给我
I want you to bring them when you come.

372
00:13:16,690 --> 00:13:19,210
你不来 是什么意思
What do you mean you're not -- not coming?

373
00:13:19,210 --> 00:13:20,656
那不可能
Well, that's not possible.

374
00:13:20,656 --> 00:13:22,790
米奇 米奇两礼拜前就发邀请给他们了
Mitch -- Mitch mailed them weeks ago.

375
00:13:22,790 --> 00:13:25,370
那派珀呢 他收到了吗
What about Pepper? Did he get his?

376
00:13:25,370 --> 00:13:26,490
那迈克尔呢
And Michael?

377
00:13:26,533 --> 00:13:28,467
那史蒂夫和斯特凡呢
And Steven and Stefan?

378
00:13:28,510 --> 00:13:29,910
还有鲍勃
And Bob?

379
00:13:29,910 --> 00:13:32,090
我得挂了
I have to go.

380
00:13:32,090 --> 00:13:34,070
打给你米奇尔舅舅
Get me your uncle Mitchell.

381
00:13:34,070 --> 00:13:36,850
我不知道他号码
I don't know his number.

382
00:13:41,310 --> 00:13:42,390
转到语音信箱了
It went to voicemail.

383
00:13:42,390 --> 00:13:43,170
当然了
Of course it did.

384
00:13:43,170 --> 00:13:45,490
一直打 直到接通
Keep trying him until you get him.

385
00:13:45,490 --> 00:13:47,290
只需一个键
it's one button.

386
00:13:47,314 --> 00:13:49,002
只要 重拨
Just...redial.

387
00:13:50,670 --> 00:13:51,877
今晚的盛大活动
Hey, really great event tonight

388
00:13:51,890 --> 00:13:55,310
回报音乐社会 回报像你一样的音乐家
benefiting the music society -- musicians like you.

389
00:14:02,010 --> 00:14:03,650
小卡舅舅呼叫米奇尔舅舅
Uncle Cam for uncle Mitchell.

390
00:14:03,650 --> 00:14:04,186
你怎么能这样 米奇尔
How could you, Mitchell?!

391
00:14:04,186 --> 00:14:05,855
说真的 给我
Honestly! Give me that.

392
00:14:05,855 --> 00:14:07,230
你想听听今晚的客人名单吗
You want to hear the guest list for night?

393
00:14:07,230 --> 00:14:10,710
目前有气愤 背叛 恐怖和伤心
So far it's anger, betrayal, terror, and sadness.

394
00:14:10,710 --> 00:14:12,867
恭喜你 米奇尔 屋子里全塞满了
Congratulations, Mitchell, you packed the house!

395
00:14:12,867 --> 00:14:14,498
小卡 我真的很抱歉
Cam, I am so sorry.

396
00:14:14,498 --> 00:14:16,750
我会搞定的 我会捐一大笔钱
I-I-I'm gonna fix it. I'll make a big donation.

397
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:17,930
那也阻止不了他们
That's not gonna keep them

398
00:14:17,930 --> 00:14:19,450
把我踢出督导委员会
from kicking me off the steering committee!

399
00:14:19,450 --> 00:14:21,230
当安德鲁走进来
When Andrew walks in here

400
00:14:21,230 --> 00:14:23,970
发现这间房里全是空着的椅子
and sees a room full of empty chairs --

401
00:14:23,970 --> 00:14:25,570
他并不是你的宿敌
You know he's not really your archenemy.

402
00:14:25,570 --> 00:14:27,310
那只是你幻想的
That's sort of a made-up thing.

403
00:14:27,310 --> 00:14:29,590
搞定它
Fix it!

404
00:14:32,947 --> 00:14:35,446
-你来了 -嗨
- Hi! You came! - Hi!

405
00:14:35,446 --> 00:14:37,450
当然得来了 我们想看你工作的样子
Of course we did. We wanted to see you work.

406
00:14:37,450 --> 00:14:39,120
我们真为你感到骄傲 甜心
We're so proud of you, sweetheart.

407
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:41,650
我们都感到自豪 我们的桌子在哪
Yeah, we're all proud. So where's our table?

408
00:14:41,650 --> 00:14:43,530
其实 有个坏消息
Actually, bad news.

409
00:14:43,673 --> 00:14:44,345
我们这里都被订满了
We totally booked.

410
00:14:44,450 --> 00:14:46,570
我们有超多的预定
We have a ton of reservations.

411
00:14:46,570 --> 00:14:49,410
是的 有一份是我们的 我预定了
Yeah, one's ours. I called.

412
00:14:49,410 --> 00:14:51,290
就在这
Here it is!

413
00:14:53,293 --> 00:14:55,370
那么你们的桌子就在这里
Uh, so, your table is right here.

414
00:14:55,370 --> 00:14:57,670
亲爱的 能给我们拿几杯饮料吗
Oh, honey, would you mind getting us a couple drinks?

415
00:14:57,670 --> 00:14:59,530
我要一杯冰茶
I would love an iced tea.

416
00:14:59,530 --> 00:15:00,450
我也是
Same, please.

417
00:15:00,962 --> 00:15:01,862
我要芒果-奇异果沙冰
I'll have a mango-kiwi smoothie,

418
00:15:01,990 --> 00:15:04,390
把冰淇淋换成酸奶 要低脂的
yogurt instead of ice cream, and make it low-fat.

419
00:15:04,390 --> 00:15:06,756
当我坐你的新车时 我得看起来很漂亮
I want to look good when I'm riding in your new car.

420
00:15:06,756 --> 00:15:08,650
亲爱的 我得说
Honey, I got to say,

421
00:15:08,650 --> 00:15:09,482
我喜欢这个发型
I like this haircut.

422
00:15:09,482 --> 00:15:10,976
在这个家里 我们都只是第二名 你才最棒
Hey, we're all just playing for second in this family.

423
00:15:12,390 --> 00:15:14,452
你喝完了吗
Were you all done here?

424
00:15:14,452 --> 00:15:16,424
没有
Uh, actually, no.

425
00:15:16,424 --> 00:15:20,370
我还要一杯冰茶
Um, I will have more iced tea,

426
00:15:20,370 --> 00:15:21,870
再来一杯冰茶
Another iced tea,

427
00:15:21,890 --> 00:15:23,941
还有一个芒果-奇异果的沙冰
and a mango-kiwi smoothie,

428
00:15:23,950 --> 00:15:25,410
全是冰淇淋的
all ice cream.

429
00:15:25,410 --> 00:15:27,470
我怀孕了
I'm pregnant.

430
00:15:27,470 --> 00:15:31,170
这很不错
Well, this is nice.

431
00:15:31,170 --> 00:15:32,390
我 我的女儿们
Me, my gals,

432
00:15:32,390 --> 00:15:34,762
还有我美丽 漂亮的媳妇
and my beautiful, beautiful wife.

433
00:15:34,762 --> 00:15:37,370
你得知道 我跟卡拉重新约定了时间
Just so you know, I rescheduled with Carla.

434
00:15:37,370 --> 00:15:39,510
我约了她12号见面
I penciled her in for the 12th...

435
00:15:39,510 --> 00:15:40,270
没说月份
of never.

436
00:15:40,270 --> 00:15:41,790
那太糟了
That's too bad.

437
00:15:41,790 --> 00:15:44,810
我还蛮希望听到点八卦的
I was kind of looking forwd to hearing about that one.

438
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:46,830
顺便告诉你
By the way,

439
00:15:46,830 --> 00:15:49,310
你出去之后没人打电话找你
no one called for you while you were out.

440
00:15:49,310 --> 00:15:50,090
要谢谢你吗
Thank you?

441
00:15:50,090 --> 00:15:51,790
我只想确定你能接到任何朋友的留言
I just want to make sure you get any messages

442
00:15:51,833 --> 00:15:53,858
但是没有人打来
from any friends who might call, which none of them did.

443
00:15:54,650 --> 00:15:57,350
海莉是这里唯一一个没带名牌的
Isn't it weird that Haley's the only one here

444
00:15:57,350 --> 00:15:58,650
这不是很奇怪吗
not wearing a name tag?

445
00:15:58,650 --> 00:15:59,990
如果你妈妈有个名牌的话
If your mother had a name tag,

446
00:15:59,990 --> 00:16:00,968
上面会写着"好司机"
it would say "Good driver."

447
00:16:00,968 --> 00:16:02,819
-菲尔 -这是你们点的
- Phil -- - Here you go.

448
00:16:07,210 --> 00:16:10,530
很流行的 说了你也不懂
Popular, which you wouldn't understand.

449
00:16:10,530 --> 00:16:11,950
还有什么能比
Well, what could be better

450
00:16:11,950 --> 00:16:13,510
和一个美女喝两杯更好
than drinks with a beautiful woman?

451
00:16:13,510 --> 00:16:16,230
每个漂亮的女人都值得拥有鲜花
And every beautiful woman deserves flowers.

452
00:16:16,230 --> 00:16:18,810
花椰菜
Cauliflowers.

453
00:16:18,810 --> 00:16:21,230
好吧 怎么回事 是因为昨晚的事吗
Okay. What's going on? Is this about last night?

454
00:16:21,230 --> 00:16:23,390
是的 我只想让你知道你对我有多重要
Yeah, I just want you to know how important to me you are.

455
00:16:23,390 --> 00:16:25,130
亲爱的 我知道 我知道
Sweetie, I know that. I know that.

456
00:16:25,130 --> 00:16:28,390
我还是感觉很糟
I still feel bad about, you know

457
00:16:28,390 --> 00:16:30,770
因为我的所作所为
what I...did.

458
00:16:30,770 --> 00:16:32,150
听我说
Listen to me.

459
00:16:32,150 --> 00:16:33,870
我们没事
You and I are fine.

460
00:16:33,870 --> 00:16:34,830
好吗
Okay?

461
00:16:34,830 --> 00:16:36,510
我真的很饿了
I'm just really hungry.

462
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:38,310
好吗
Okay?

463
00:16:38,310 --> 00:16:40,290
好的
Okay.

464
00:16:40,290 --> 00:16:40,770
好的
Okay.

465
00:16:40,770 --> 00:16:42,830
那行
All right!

466
00:16:42,830 --> 00:16:44,716
什么看起来好吃呢
What looks good?

467
00:16:44,716 --> 00:16:46,018
天啊
Oh, gosh.

468
00:16:46,018 --> 00:16:47,716
有东西从这一页跳出来了
Ooh, here's something that jumps right off the page.

469
00:16:47,716 --> 00:16:49,018
我昨天吃过这道菜
Uh-huh. I tried this yesterday,

470
00:16:49,018 --> 00:16:51,050
多亏我朋友斯基普·伍斯纳的推荐
thanks to my good friend Skip Woosnum.

471
00:16:51,050 --> 00:16:53,070
克莱尔 帮自己一个忙
Claire, do yourself a favor

472
00:16:53,070 --> 00:16:57,090
跟我一起来一份卷心菜沙拉吧
and join me in a wedge salad.

473
00:16:57,090 --> 00:16:59,850
你不是在跟我开玩笑吧
You have got to be kidding me!

474
00:16:59,850 --> 00:17:01,730
只要尝一口 你就会感谢我的
Just try it. You will thank me.

475
00:17:01,730 --> 00:17:03,970
通过昨晚的事 你什么都没学到吗
Did you learn nothing from last night?

476
00:17:04,490 --> 00:17:06,230
是因为沙拉吗
It was about the salad?

477
00:17:06,230 --> 00:17:08,650
几年来 我一直推荐卷心菜沙拉给你
I have been recommending wedge salads to you,

478
00:17:08,650 --> 00:17:10,430
还有别的东西
amongst other things, for years,

479
00:17:10,430 --> 00:17:11,690
但你从来都不听我的
and you never listen to me.

480
00:17:11,690 --> 00:17:13,070
然后某个蠢蛋向你推荐
And then some idiot suggests it,

481
00:17:13,070 --> 00:17:15,290
你就等不及想去吃卷心菜沙拉
and you can't wait to try a wedge salad?!

482
00:17:15,290 --> 00:17:18,790
这让我觉得我不重要
It makes me feel like I don't matter.

483
00:17:18,790 --> 00:17:20,873
太感谢你了 老爸
Thanks a lot, dad!

484
00:17:20,873 --> 00:17:25,088
妈妈的小发作让我被解雇了
Mom's little outburst just got me fired!

485
00:17:25,088 --> 00:17:28,090
好的 我得去跟你妈妈谈谈
Okay, I got to talk to your mom.

486
00:17:28,090 --> 00:17:28,988
你去安慰你的姐姐
You comfort your sister.

487
00:17:28,988 --> 00:17:31,375
她从未在这里工作过
She never worked here!

488
00:17:35,079 --> 00:17:36,071
米奇尔也给你打电话了
So, Mitchell called you, too.

489
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:47,870
我想你还没跟歌洛莉亚谈过
I take it you haven't had your conversation with Gloria yet?

490
00:17:47,870 --> 00:17:48,530
情况更糟了
It's getting worse.

491
00:17:48,838 --> 00:17:49,712
来的时候 她唱了一路
She sang all the way here.

492
00:17:50,030 --> 00:17:50,577
我们经过两辆车
We passed two cars --

493
00:17:50,577 --> 00:17:51,758
车里的狗都把头缩回车内了
the dogs stuck their heads back inside the window.

494
00:17:52,930 --> 00:17:58,070
我们接下来该怎么做
What are we gonna do?

495
00:17:58,070 --> 00:18:01,010
-我可以点一场大火 -不
- I could start a fire. - No.

496
00:18:01,870 --> 00:18:03,150
把这个当做备用对策
Keep that in your back pocket.

497
00:18:05,830 --> 00:18:07,070
我想给你看点东西
I want to show you something.

498
00:18:07,070 --> 00:18:08,050
让我猜一猜
Let me guess.

499
00:18:08,050 --> 00:18:09,370
是一本我求了你很久
It's a copy of "The Book Thief"

500
00:18:09,370 --> 00:18:10,530
叫你去读读的叫《偷书贼》的书
that I begged you to read,

501
00:18:10,530 --> 00:18:12,430
直到你的牙科医生说这本书改变了她的一生
but you wouldn't until your dental hygienist

502
00:18:12,430 --> 00:18:14,430
你才去读的
said it changed her life.

503
00:18:14,430 --> 00:18:17,370
-记得这个吗 -是啊
- Remember this? - Uh-huh.

504
00:18:17,370 --> 00:18:19,410
这是我跟你家人度过的第一个感恩节
It's the first thanksgiving I spent with your family.

505
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:21,350
天 我真讨厌那马尾辫
God, I hated that ponytail.

506
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:22,370
我知道
I know.

507
00:18:22,370 --> 00:18:24,110
你说它让我看起来像一个懦弱的保镖
You said it made me look like a wimpy bouncer,

508
00:18:24,110 --> 00:18:25,190
所以我就把它剪了
so I cut it off.

509
00:18:25,197 --> 00:18:27,370
就像我摘掉了羽毛耳环
Just like I lost the feathered earring...

510
00:18:27,370 --> 00:18:29,910
还有豆袋椅面包车
and the van with the beanbag chairs.

511
00:18:29,910 --> 00:18:32,030
而且我也换了我的专业
And I changed my forestry major.

512
00:18:32,030 --> 00:18:34,370
我明白 菲尔 我明白
I get it, Phil. I get it.

513
00:18:34,370 --> 00:18:35,370
我就是个控制欲极强的巫婆
I am the controlling witch

514
00:18:35,628 --> 00:18:36,866
-让你放弃所有你喜欢的东西 -不不
- that made you give up everything fun in your l-- - No. No.

515
00:18:37,165 --> 00:18:38,021
你是那个拯救了我的女巫
You're the witch who saved me.

516
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:40,510
看 看这张照片
Look. Look at this picture.

517
00:18:40,510 --> 00:18:41,990
现在看看这个人
Now look at this guy.

518
00:18:41,990 --> 00:18:45,070
你不能告诉我说你的意见不重要
You can't tell me your opinion doesn't matter.

519
00:18:45,070 --> 00:18:47,845
你用上百种方式使我变得更好
You changed me for the better in a hundred different ways.

520
00:18:47,845 --> 00:18:50,857
是的 我或许错过了一本书或一份沙拉
Yeah, I-I might miss a book or a salad

521
00:18:50,857 --> 00:18:52,587
七七八八的 但是
here and there, but...

522
00:18:52,587 --> 00:18:55,010
但是我身上都是卡莱尔的印记
I've got Claire all over me.

523
00:18:55,010 --> 00:18:58,390
等下我就会在你上面
You're about to.

524
00:18:58,390 --> 00:19:04,090
这是世界上最难听的声音
That's the worst sound in the world.

525
00:19:04,090 --> 00:19:04,930
是吗
Is it?

526
00:19:05,116 --> 00:19:07,249
朋友们 亲人们 董事会的成员们
Friends, uh, family, uh, board members --

527
00:19:07,435 --> 00:19:08,267
是很无聊啊
"Bored" is right.

528
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:12,170
我知道我们都很期待
I know we were all looking forward

529
00:19:12,170 --> 00:19:15,310
欣赏一场美妙的竖琴演奏
to hearing the beautiful stylings of harp attack,

530
00:19:15,310 --> 00:19:17,722
但是很不辛 有点小小的...
but there has, unfortunately, been a slight --

531
00:19:17,722 --> 00:19:18,950
先别开始
Don't start yet!

532
00:19:18,950 --> 00:19:19,810
推迟
delay,

533
00:19:19,810 --> 00:19:22,810
节目会在几分钟后准时开始
and the program will start in a few minutes, on time.

534
00:19:22,810 --> 00:19:24,750
请大家就坐吧
Uh, so, please, everyone take their seats.

535
00:19:24,750 --> 00:19:25,610
谢谢
Thank you.

536
00:19:25,610 --> 00:19:28,310
天啊 你做到了
Oh, my god, you did it!

537
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:29,330
算是吧
Sort of.

538
00:19:29,330 --> 00:19:31,064
我知道这不是你盼望的那样
I know this isn't what you were hoping for,

539
00:19:31,064 --> 00:19:34,084
但在聆听方面 我必须做的更好
but I need to do a better job of listening to you.

540
00:19:34,084 --> 00:19:34,970
不不 你尽了全力
No, no, you did the best you could,

541
00:19:34,970 --> 00:19:37,310
再说了 这可比去年安德鲁的"大提琴潜水艇"
and, plus, this is double what Andrew had last year

542
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:38,170
出席人数多了一倍
for "Cello submarine."

543
00:19:38,170 --> 00:19:38,990
谢谢你
Thank you.

544
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:40,450
在如此叫好的时刻
Oh -- how are you sitting at a harp

545
00:19:41,190 --> 00:19:43,470
坐在竖琴前的你们怎能不表示一下呢 女士们
and not scoring this moment? Ladies!

546
00:19:43,470 --> 00:19:54,090
如果你不是一个好的聆听者
You can't have a successful marriage

547
00:19:54,090 --> 00:19:56,230
那么你就不会有美满的婚姻
without being a good listener.

548
00:19:56,230 --> 00:19:57,710
有时候得费点小功夫
Sometimes it takes a little work...

549
00:19:57,710 --> 00:19:59,090
我只是想知道 他们会怎么
I just wonder what they're gonna do

550
00:19:59,090 --> 00:19:59,810
对待他们的生命 你知道吗
with their lives, you know?

551
00:19:59,810 --> 00:20:01,410
我只是想知道 他们是如何
I just wonder how they can actually, you know,

552
00:20:01,410 --> 00:20:03,690
找到与竖琴之间的感应
ever find their true calling with a harp.

553
00:20:03,690 --> 00:20:06,470
有时候得花点大功夫
...sometimes it takes a lot of work...

554
00:20:06,470 --> 00:20:09,090
竖琴
Harps!

555
00:20:09,090 --> 00:20:14,210
有时候它只是痛苦
...and sometimes it's just excruciating.

556
00:20:14,604 --> 00:20:16,519
杰 过来 我又学会一首歌了
Jay, come. I work out another song.

557
00:20:16,519 --> 00:20:20,042
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

558
00:20:20,578 --> 00:20:21,486
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

559
00:20:21,486 --> 00:20:22,821
不
No!

560
00:20:22,821 --> 00:20:24,550
不不不不
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

561
00:20:24,550 --> 00:20:26,210
我再也忍受不了了
I can't take it anymore!

562
00:20:26,210 --> 00:20:28,390
好吗 这不是唱歌 这是鬼叫
Okay? It's not singing, it's screaming.

563
00:20:28,390 --> 00:20:30,470
妈妈 我爱你 但是看在上帝的份上
Mom, I love you, but for the love of god,

564
00:20:32,059 --> 00:20:34,834
在它毁了这个家之前把这个毁了
destroy that thing before it destroys this family!

565
00:20:36,390 --> 00:20:36,870
胆小鬼
Coward!

566
00:20:36,870 --> 00:20:38,290
我认为你唱的很不错
I think you sound great,

567
00:20:38,608 --> 00:20:39,715
但是这吵到孩子的话
but if it bothers e kid...

568
00:20:40,061 --> 00:20:40,746
胆小鬼
Coward!

569
00:20:53,930 --> 00:20:56,690
丹尼 孩子
Oh Danny boy

570
00:20:56,690 --> 00:21:00,570
那笛声在呼唤着你
The pipes, the pipes are calling

571
00:21:00,946 --> 00:21:06,954
从一个峡谷到另一个峡谷 到了山的那头
From glen to glen, and down the mountain side

572
00:21:07,330 --> 00:21:12,350
夏天已远去 所有的玫瑰...
The summer's gone, and all the roses...

573
00:21:12,350 --> 00:21:15,430
你继续这样的话
You keep this up,

574
00:21:15,430 --> 00:21:17,870
这就不会是我拔的最后一个插头
and this won't be the last plug I pull.
